    "name": "WayPoint",
    "steam_appid": 3398940,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398940/extras/571f202b614afdee41315676d9994d61.avif?t=1743228158\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><strong>Introduction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Waypoint</i>\u2014a turn-based strategy game for up to four players! Every step is a fight for survival, where you can either reach the finish line to claim victory or eliminate all opponents to be the last one standing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Waypoint</i> offers a unique approach: there are no good events here. Every occurrence on the map is a challenge designed to make your journey harder. Your only hope? That your opponents have it even worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carve your path to victory, sabotage your rivals, and use the dynamic event system to get ahead. Only intelligence, cunning, and a bit of luck will lead you to triumph!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Relentless Events</strong> \u2013 Forget about assistance\u2014<i>Waypoint</i> has no friendly events. Tornadoes, fog, destruction\u2014everything works against you. Just make sure your rivals suffer even more!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398940/extras/abf1c60f23a8f892bff53e6874f99253.poster.avif?t=1743228158\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398940/extras/abf1c60f23a8f892bff53e6874f99253.webm?t=1743228158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398940/extras/abf1c60f23a8f892bff53e6874f99253.mp4?t=1743228158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Two Ways to Win</strong> \u2013 Be the first to reach the finish line or eliminate all your opponents to stand alone as the ultimate victor.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398940/extras/e9c6de1383ea667f5cf52b4c5655889e.poster.avif?t=1743228158\" width=684 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398940/extras/e9c6de1383ea667f5cf52b4c5655889e.webm?t=1743228158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398940/extras/e9c6de1383ea667f5cf52b4c5655889e.mp4?t=1743228158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Dynamic Map</strong> \u2013 Fight, build roads, and use the terrain to your advantage in this high-stakes race.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398940/extras/fcc3d24429b2dbc9ed50002412cfbe37.poster.avif?t=1743228158\" width=694 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398940/extras/fcc3d24429b2dbc9ed50002412cfbe37.webm?t=1743228158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398940/extras/fcc3d24429b2dbc9ed50002412cfbe37.mp4?t=1743228158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>A Living World</strong> \u2013 Explore detailed tiles, from dense forests to ruins hiding mysterious items that can either aid or hinder you.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398940/extras/dc4fdf74d54e18e72661022f28920fc7.poster.avif?t=1743228158\" width=694 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398940/extras/dc4fdf74d54e18e72661022f28920fc7.webm?t=1743228158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398940/extras/dc4fdf74d54e18e72661022f28920fc7.mp4?t=1743228158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 <strong>Up to 4 Players</strong> \u2013 Compete with friends, AI bots, or online opponents in a strategic showdown where every move counts.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398940/extras/5fd3c70310980ccfa045f2ac5bfcf841.poster.avif?t=1743228158\" width=694 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398940/extras/5fd3c70310980ccfa045f2ac5bfcf841.webm?t=1743228158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398940/extras/5fd3c70310980ccfa045f2ac5bfcf841.mp4?t=1743228158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Early Access!</strong> \ud83d\udd39</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Waypoint</i> is currently in active development! That means you can play right now, shape its future, and be part of its evolution. We are constantly adding new content, improving mechanics, and refining balance based on player feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coming Soon:</strong><br>\u2714\ufe0f New mechanics and gameplay improvements<br>\u2714\ufe0f Additional events and content<br>\u2714\ufe0f Performance optimization and balance tweaks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join early access, experience the game first, and help us make <i>Waypoint</i> even better! \ud83d\ude80</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398940/extras/571f202b614afdee41315676d9994d61.avif?t=1743228158\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><strong>Introduction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Waypoint</i>\u2014a turn-based strategy game for up to four players! Every step is a fight for survival, where you can either reach the finish line to claim victory or eliminate all opponents to be the last one standing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Waypoint</i> offers a unique approach: there are no good events here. Every occurrence on the map is a challenge designed to make your journey harder. Your only hope? That your opponents have it even worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carve your path to victory, sabotage your rivals, and use the dynamic event system to get ahead. Only intelligence, cunning, and a bit of luck will lead you to triumph!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Relentless Events</strong> \u2013 Forget about assistance\u2014<i>Waypoint</i> has no friendly events. Tornadoes, fog, destruction\u2014everything works against you. Just make sure your rivals suffer even more!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398940/extras/abf1c60f23a8f892bff53e6874f99253.poster.avif?t=1743228158\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398940/extras/abf1c60f23a8f892bff53e6874f99253.webm?t=1743228158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398940/extras/abf1c60f23a8f892bff53e6874f99253.mp4?t=1743228158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Two Ways to Win</strong> \u2013 Be the first to reach the finish line or eliminate all your opponents to stand alone as the ultimate victor.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398940/extras/e9c6de1383ea667f5cf52b4c5655889e.poster.avif?t=1743228158\" width=684 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398940/extras/e9c6de1383ea667f5cf52b4c5655889e.webm?t=1743228158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398940/extras/e9c6de1383ea667f5cf52b4c5655889e.mp4?t=1743228158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Dynamic Map</strong> \u2013 Fight, build roads, and use the terrain to your advantage in this high-stakes race.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398940/extras/fcc3d24429b2dbc9ed50002412cfbe37.poster.avif?t=1743228158\" width=694 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398940/extras/fcc3d24429b2dbc9ed50002412cfbe37.webm?t=1743228158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398940/extras/fcc3d24429b2dbc9ed50002412cfbe37.mp4?t=1743228158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>A Living World</strong> \u2013 Explore detailed tiles, from dense forests to ruins hiding mysterious items that can either aid or hinder you.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398940/extras/dc4fdf74d54e18e72661022f28920fc7.poster.avif?t=1743228158\" width=694 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398940/extras/dc4fdf74d54e18e72661022f28920fc7.webm?t=1743228158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398940/extras/dc4fdf74d54e18e72661022f28920fc7.mp4?t=1743228158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 <strong>Up to 4 Players</strong> \u2013 Compete with friends, AI bots, or online opponents in a strategic showdown where every move counts.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398940/extras/5fd3c70310980ccfa045f2ac5bfcf841.poster.avif?t=1743228158\" width=694 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398940/extras/5fd3c70310980ccfa045f2ac5bfcf841.webm?t=1743228158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398940/extras/5fd3c70310980ccfa045f2ac5bfcf841.mp4?t=1743228158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Early Access!</strong> \ud83d\udd39</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Waypoint</i> is currently in active development! That means you can play right now, shape its future, and be part of its evolution. We are constantly adding new content, improving mechanics, and refining balance based on player feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coming Soon:</strong><br>\u2714\ufe0f New mechanics and gameplay improvements<br>\u2714\ufe0f Additional events and content<br>\u2714\ufe0f Performance optimization and balance tweaks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join early access, experience the game first, and help us make <i>Waypoint</i> even better! \ud83d\ude80</p>",
